\caption{Conservatism metric $C = \hat{p} - \alpha$ for each model on FIBRATC14.MX ($n = 62$, 95\% VaR). Negative values (blue/green) indicate conservative models; positive values (red) indicate anti-conservative models. GARCH-$t$ is the only model with $C \approx 0$.}
\label{fig:conservatism}
